window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>The second thrilling installment in the epic Silent Archmage fantasy series unveils a tale of magic, war, and a kingdom on the brink of destruction.</b><br><br>War is coming. The kingdom is not ready…but Syl is.<br> <br>Syl’s first semester at the Aurian Magical Institute has been more eventful than he hoped for as he was thrust into a world of dark magic, deadly battles, and ancient secrets. After a devastating clash that left hundreds of Cascadian magicians dead, Syl knows peace is no longer an option. He and Bianca have had enough of war, but their names are still feared across the seas for no reason. They will not go gently.<br> <br>As neighboring nations descend upon the kingdom and Auria starts to splinter apart on the inside, Syl realizes that this feud goes far deeper than a simple land grab. Something deeper is afoot, and the ongoing storm may plunge the entire world back into a war it can’t afford.<br> <br>Pride goes before the fall. The Silent Archmage has returned."; 
